{"seq":2,"slug":"visibility-performance","title":"可见性性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/practice/visibility-performance","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"可见性性能\">可见性性能</h1><p>可见性系统的性能是会爆炸的那种：单位数、地图格数、视野半径三者相乘，外加每个还要每帧、每玩家算一遍。一个没上预算的迷雾系统，能在单位规模翻倍时把帧时间从 2 毫秒推到 20 毫秒，吃掉整个 CPU 余量。本篇给可见性系统上工程预算：可见性更新该多久跑一次、用什么空间结构裁掉无谓计算、怎样把工作摊到多帧与多线程、以及低端机上如何优雅降级。它统筹前面所有章节产生的开销——<a href=\"../computation/shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 的计算、<a href=\"../systems/fog-networking\">迷雾网络同步</a> 的带宽、<a href=\"fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a> 的 GPU 时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可见性的总开销可粗略写成几个因子的乘积：单位数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、单视野计算代价（半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）、更新频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>、玩家/阵营数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>开销</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{开销} \\approx N \\cdot O(r^2) \\cdot f \\cdot P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开销</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>优化就是逐个因子地往下压：减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（剔除静止单位）、减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（预计算/查表）、减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>（降频与摊帧）、减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>（阵营共享）。没有银弹，只有针对瓶颈因子的针对性削减——所以第一步永远是 profile，找出乘积里哪个因子在主导。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[可见性总开销] --&gt; B[N 单位数]&#10;    A --&gt; C[r² 单视野代价]&#10;    A --&gt; D[f 更新频率]&#10;    A --&gt; E[P 玩家/阵营数]&#10;    B --&gt; F[只重算移动单位]&#10;    C --&gt; G[预计算查表/降半径]&#10;    D --&gt; H[降频 + 多帧摊销]&#10;    E --&gt; I[阵营共享一份场]&#10;    F --&gt; J[先 profile 定位主导因子]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[可见性总开销] --&gt; B[N 单位数]\n    A --&gt; C[r² 单视野代价]\n    A --&gt; D[f 更新频率]\n    A --&gt; E[P 玩家/阵营数]\n    B --&gt; F[只重算移动单位]\n    C --&gt; G[预计算查表/降半径]\n    D --&gt; H[降频 + 多帧摊销]\n    E --&gt; I[阵营共享一份场]\n    F --&gt; J[先 profile 定位主导因子]\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>削减的因子</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引用计数增量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（只算移动者）</td>\n<td>内存（记每单位视野）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预计算可见表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（查代替算）</td>\n<td>内存（每格可见集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降频 + 摊帧</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可见性最多滞后几帧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阵营共享场</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>队友强制共视野</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间分区裁剪</td>\n<td>常数项</td>\n<td>维护分区结构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"更新频率与摊帧\">更新频率与摊帧</h2><p>可见性不必每帧每单位都算。两个独立的降频思路。<strong>降频</strong>：把可见性更新从每帧（60 Hz）降到比如 10–20 Hz，中间帧用上一次结果——人眼对迷雾边缘的滞后几十毫秒并不敏感，但能立省数倍。<strong>摊帧（time-slicing）</strong>：不在一帧里算完所有单位，而是把单位分成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 组，每帧只更新一组，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 帧轮完一遍——把一次大尖峰摊成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个小开销，平滑帧时间。</p>\n<p>摊帧的代价是单个单位的可见性最多滞后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 帧，对慢速 RTS 单位无所谓，对高速 FPS 则要谨慎（<a href=\"../systems/fog-anti-cheat\">迷雾与反作弊</a> 提到的「即将可见」提前量会被滞后吃掉，可能露脸延迟）。所以摊帧分组常按重要性：玩家附近/高速单位每帧算，远处/静止单位低频算。降频与摊帧是 CPU 侧最廉价、最先该上的优化，因为它们直接砍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 这个因子，且几乎不改算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"空间分区-别给整张图做无用功\">空间分区：别给整张图做无用功</h2><p>朴素实现每帧遍历整张网格找观察者、给每个观察者扫整片半径——大量计算花在「这附近根本没单位也没视野变化」的空旷格上。<strong>空间分区</strong>把地图切成区块（grid/quadtree），只处理「有观察者或可见性可能变化」的活跃区块。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[地图切成区块] --&gt; B[标记活跃区块&lt;br/&gt;有观察者或单位移动]&#10;    B --&gt; C[只重算活跃区块的可见性]&#10;    C --&gt; D[空旷/静止区块跳过]&#10;    D --&gt; E[脏标记: 地形变化才重算该块]\">flowchart TD\n    A[地图切成区块] --&gt; B[标记活跃区块&lt;br/&gt;有观察者或单位移动]\n    B --&gt; C[只重算活跃区块的可见性]\n    C --&gt; D[空旷/静止区块跳过]\n    D --&gt; E[脏标记: 地形变化才重算该块]</pre><p>分区还配合<strong>脏标记（dirty flag）</strong>：静态地形的可见性（来自 <a href=\"../computation/grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 的预计算表）只在地形改变（拆墙、造建筑）时把受影响区块标脏重算，平时纯查表。动态遮挡的局部重算思路，和寻路里导航网格的局部更新同源——见 <a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/dynamic-obstacles-replan\">寻路的动态障碍与重规划（36）</a>。空间分区削的是开销公式里的常数与有效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，是中大型地图的必备。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多线程与数据布局\">多线程与数据布局</h2><p>可见性计算天然并行：不同观察者的 FOV 互不依赖（都只读地形、各写各的可见集，或用原子累加写共享场）。把每个观察者的阴影投射当成一个 job 丢进任务系统，能近线性地吃满多核。前提是数据布局对并行友好——地形用紧凑的位图（cache 友好）、可见集用 per-job 的本地缓冲再归并，避免伪共享。</p>\n<p>这把可见性优化和通用的数据导向设计绑在一起：把单位的视野参数（位置、半径）打包成连续数组（SoA）而非分散的对象，让 job 顺序扫过、cache 命中率高。多线程任务调度与 cache 友好布局的通用原则属于性能优化范畴，见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">性能优化的缓存与数据导向（24）</a> 和 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/multithreading-jobs\">多线程与 Job 系统（24）</a>；本篇只强调可见性恰是 job 化的理想对象。GPU 路线（把可见性场算在显卡上）则把整个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 维度并行掉，代价见 <a href=\"../computation/grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 的 GPU 小节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三处预算与降级\">三处预算与降级</h2><p>可见性的开销分布在三处，预算要分开守。<strong>CPU</strong>：逻辑可见性计算（FOV、增量更新），用降频/摊帧/分区/多线程压。<strong>带宽</strong>：<a href=\"../systems/fog-networking\">迷雾网络同步</a> 的下发，用 delta、量化、距离 LOD 压。<strong>GPU</strong>：<a href=\"fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a> 的全屏混合与采样，用低分辨率纹理、合批压。三处往往此消彼长——把可见性算到 GPU 省了 CPU 却加了 GPU，要看哪块是瓶颈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[可见性预算] --&gt; B[CPU: 逻辑计算]&#10;    A --&gt; C[带宽: 同步下发]&#10;    A --&gt; D[GPU: 迷雾渲染]&#10;    B --&gt; E[降频/摊帧/分区/多线程]&#10;    C --&gt; F[delta/量化/距离LOD]&#10;    D --&gt; G[低分辨率纹理/合批]&#10;    H[低端机降级] --&gt; I[降可见性分辨率]&#10;    H --&gt; J[降更新频率]&#10;    H --&gt; K[关时间平滑/体积雾]\">flowchart TD\n    A[可见性预算] --&gt; B[CPU: 逻辑计算]\n    A --&gt; C[带宽: 同步下发]\n    A --&gt; D[GPU: 迷雾渲染]\n    B --&gt; E[降频/摊帧/分区/多线程]\n    C --&gt; F[delta/量化/距离LOD]\n    D --&gt; G[低分辨率纹理/合批]\n    H[低端机降级] --&gt; I[降可见性分辨率]\n    H --&gt; J[降更新频率]\n    H --&gt; K[关时间平滑/体积雾]</pre><p>低端机的<strong>优雅降级</strong>遵循「先降表现、再降精度、绝不降逻辑」：先关掉时间平滑和体积雾（纯视觉），再降可见性纹理分辨率和更新频率（略糊略滞后），但逻辑可见性的正确性和反作弊剔除永不降级——后者一降就是公平和安全问题。先 profile 定位瓶颈在 CPU/带宽/GPU 哪一处，再对症下药，是这一切的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可见性开销约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot O(r^2) \\cdot f \\cdot P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，优化即逐因子削减；第一步永远是 profile 定位主导因子。</li>\n<li>降频（10–20 Hz）和摊帧（按重要性分组轮算）是最廉价的 CPU 优化，直接砍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，但滞后会吃掉反作弊的提前量，高速单位需谨慎。</li>\n<li>空间分区 + 脏标记只重算活跃/变化区块，静态地形纯查表，削有效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与常数，中大图必备。</li>\n<li>可见性天然 job 化（观察者间独立），配合 SoA 布局吃满多核；GPU 路线并行掉整个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 维度，代价是 GPU 占用。</li>\n<li>预算分 CPU/带宽/GPU 三处分守、此消彼长；低端机降级遵循「先降表现、再降精度、绝不降逻辑与反作弊」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：渲染开销细节见 <a href=\"fog-rendering\">迷雾渲染</a>；性能取舍如何影响手感见 <a href=\"fog-game-feel\">迷雾的玩法表现</a>。</li>\n<li>计算与系统：被优化的算法是 <a href=\"../computation/shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 与 <a href=\"../computation/grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a>；带宽侧见 <a href=\"../systems/fog-networking\">迷雾网络同步</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented\">性能优化的缓存与数据导向</a>、<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/cpu/multithreading-jobs\">多线程与 Job 系统</a>、<a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/navigation-meshes/dynamic-obstacles-replan\">寻路的动态障碍与重规划</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可见性性能","id":"可见性性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"更新频率与摊帧","id":"更新频率与摊帧"},{"level":2,"text":"空间分区：别给整张图做无用功","id":"空间分区-别给整张图做无用功"},{"level":2,"text":"多线程与数据布局","id":"多线程与数据布局"},{"level":2,"text":"三处预算与降级","id":"三处预算与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"迷雾渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/practice/fog-rendering"},"next":{"title":"迷雾的玩法表现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/practice/fog-game-feel"}}